menu "ESP-C6-UNIT01 relay control"

config APP_RELAY_ACTIVE_LOW
    bool "Relay inputs are active LOW"
    default y
    help
        Enabled: LOW energizes a coil and HIGH releases it.
        Disable for a relay module with active-HIGH inputs.
        Verify the actual module before connecting the controlled equipment.

config APP_RELAY_SETTLE_MS
    int "Delay between relay switching stages (ms)"
    range 10 500
    default 30
    help
        Must exceed the module's relay operate/release/bounce times.
        K1 Low (10 kOhm), K2 High (4 kOhm), K3 Exchange (~0 Ohm)
        and K4 Off (21 kOhm) are mutually exclusive. Every change opens
        the active contact before another one is closed.

endmenu
